          "workerLocal",
          "pipeLocal",
          "exitWatch",
          "settle"
        ],
        "note": "CLI 进程内的循环全程守着：起子进程、逐行读事件、当场看退出。关掉 CLI 即中止。"
      },
      {
        "id": "run-cloud",
        "label": "run × cloud",
        "focus": [
          "entry",
          "foreLoop",
          "dispatch",
          "workerCloud",
          "tableCloud",
          "exitWatch",
          "settle"
        ],
        "note": "同一个循环换云端载体：任务在云上跑、事件轮询读回。关掉 CLI 只是放弃收结果，任务照跑照计费。"
      },
      {
        "id": "submit-local",
        "label": "submit × local",
        "focus": [
          "entry",
          "bgProc",
          "stepOnce",
          "dispatch",
          "workerLocal",
          "pipeLocal",
          "storeLocal",
          "exitWatch",
          "settle"
